l, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>第二就是顶部。那我们来看一下，首先上周高点没有放量加速上涨，散户疯狂情绪这些顶部迹象。</span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>其次，就算真是顶部，15年、18年和今年的高点，大跌之后，都会先给反弹。起码是反弹下跌幅度一半，那时候再考虑出局不迟。</span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>3，今天的下跌确实有点破位了，破了趋势线下轨，反弹后是有可能继续跌的。上证指数再下方趋势线支撑在3265，也就是说大盘可能还有4%的空间。</span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>仓位重的可以反弹后减仓一部分，如果你拿的低估值板块，银行，保险，中证500等，我建议抗住就可以了，甚至还可以补仓。因为这些长线板块，下方空间小，上方空间很大。不要在乎短线几个点的得失而因小失大。</span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>总的来讲，现在先等反弹，看力度再分析。</span><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>新手怕大跌，但高手不怕，因为高手知道，大跌才是上天赐给交易者的礼物。</span><br/></p></div>",
